# What this repo takes from ContainerHub. One row per asset: the id from
# third_party/ContainerHub/shared/config/shared-assets.manifest, and a path only
# when the copy does not sit at that registry row default.
#
# Checked by:
#   bash third_party/ContainerHub/shared/config/sync-shared-config.sh --repo-root . --check
#
# The four names NOT listed here are not overrides - this Flutter app carries no
# CMakeLists.txt, no C++ and no Dart pre-commit hooks, so .clang-format,
# .clang-tidy, gcovr.cfg and .pre-commit-config.yaml were never taken. AGENTS.md
# paragraph 4 records the same fact.

cmake-format
containerhub-sh
resolve-build-module
